  "description": "The process of becoming stronger and more confident, especially in controlling one’s own life. The meme implicitly references empowerment, as the girl’s expression of joy and excitement with her wheelchair suggests she is embracing her identity and capabilities, which is a central theme in disability advocacy and self-actualization.",
